From: Shahriar Iravanian <siravan@svtsim.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:10:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] rusticol: record mode of the pacman hook, for pacuda
 convert (local, e2e)

recurrence::direct_backend::pacman_record(f) runs f with every plan run recorded as the runner
would get it (program, scales, factors, run lists, momentum-form tables; sources, forms and
symjit kernels on the device, symjit kernels by SHA-256) while the CPU runs the plan; the LC
lane's resolved reduction adds each (amplitude plane, weight, helicity) to the run. No runner is
needed. NativeRuntime::pacman_input_crossing gives the input crossing. execute shares the scale
and amplitude-run code with the recording (call_scales, amplitude_runs).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
